    schemeCitation: "Marking points quoted from the SEC marking scheme, Engineering 2010 Higher Level — © State Examinations Commission.",
    id: "eng-2010-hl-q7-b-iii", topicId: "eng-2-11", conceptId: "suggest-safety-precautions-would-minimise-formation",
    section: "A", questionRef: "2010 HL Q7(b)(iii)",
    questionText: "The main types of material chip formed in metal cutting are illustrated below. Suggest three safety precautions that would minimise the formation of a built-up edge as shown in C.",
