    id: "eng-2018-hl-q1-o-i", topicId: "eng-2-15", conceptId: "hovering-fixed-elevated-position",
    section: "A", questionRef: "2018 HL Q1(o)(i)",
    questionText: "The propeller layout of a typical drone quadcopter is shown. Drone movement is dependant on both propellor rotation and appropriate speed. Describe both the rotation and associated speed for each propellor A, B, C and D for the following flight operations: Hovering in a fixed elevated position;",
