    schemeCitation: "Marking points quoted from the SEC marking scheme, Engineering 2018 Higher Level — © State Examinations Commission.",
    id: "eng-2018-hl-q1-o-ii", topicId: "eng-2-15", conceptId: "forward-movement-direction-arrow-x",
    section: "A", questionRef: "2018 HL Q1(o)(ii)",
    questionText: "The propeller layout of a typical drone quadcopter is shown. Drone movement is dependant on both propellor rotation and appropriate speed. Describe both the rotation and associated speed for each propellor A, B, C and D for the following flight operations: Forward movement in the direction of arrow X.",
