          "src": "/exam-figures/engineering/markbank/engineering-2018-HL-scheme-q1oii-sol.png",
          "srcHash": "809a50ec0cc83fddb207f9aba69aa319",
          "alt": "The marking scheme's printed answer for 2018 HL Q1(o)(ii), as the State Examinations Commission set it. It reads: Higher speed B A C D Lower speed X.",
