          "src": "/exam-figures/engineering/markbank/engineering-2023-HL-deferred-scheme-q4c-sol.png",
          "srcHash": "ddec17dd7a0fef9b7534f179f5e2f3cf",
          "alt": "The marking scheme's printed answer for 2023 HL deferred Q4(c)(i), as the State Examinations Commission set it.",
