          "alt": "The marking scheme's printed answer for 2026 HL Q9(a)(ii), as the State Examinations Commission set it. It reads: connecting rod slider holding chamber crank motor and rotating shaft.",
          "attribution": "SEC Leaving Certificate Engineering 2026 Higher Level — © State Examinations Commission",
          "solution": true,
